{
    "_comment": [
        "Overlay of esp-brookesia's launcher tile template for the AMOLED 1.8 V2.",
        "",
        "Single delta from upstream: the clicked effect no longer sets",
        "requireValidPress. Upstream had requireValidPress:true, which makes",
        "runtime_binding.cpp drop the emitted action whenever the view saw an",
        "LV_EVENT_PRESS_LOST between press and release. The launcher grid is a",
        "scrollable container, so LVGL hands it any touch that drifts even a few",
        "pixels -- the tile takes the press, the scroller steals the gesture, the",
        "tap is discarded, and the app just doesn't open. That is the framework",
        "half of 'touch sensitivity is still a challenge'.",
        "",
        "uikit/tokens.json already records this as a kit rule",
        "(traps.forbid_require_valid_press) from #205; the shell is upstream code",
        "and was never linted against our own kit."
    ],
    "type": "viewTemplate",
    "id": "launcher_app_button",
    "node": {
        "type": "button",
        "bindings": {
            "placement.x": "x",
            "placement.y": "y"
        },
        "interactionRefs": [
            "press.scale"
        ],
        "events": [
            {
                "type": "clicked",
                "effects": [
                    {
                        "type": "emitAction",
                        "action": "super.launch.app"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "style": {
            "padding": 0
        },
        "layout": {
            "type": "flex",
            "flexFlow": "column",
            "gap": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherLabelGap}",
            "mainAlign": "center",
            "crossAlign": "center"
        },
        "placement": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "width": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherItemWidth}",
            "height": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherItemHeight}"
        },
        "children": [
            {
                "type": "container",
                "id": "icon_box",
                "commonProps": {
                    "clickable": false
                },
                "layout": {
                    "type": "flex",
                    "mainAlign": "center",
                    "crossAlign": "center"
                },
                "placement": {
                    "width": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherIconTileSize}",
                    "height": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherIconTileSize}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "image",
                        "id": "icon_image",
                        "commonProps": {
                            "clickable": false,
                            "hidden": true
                        },
                        "bindings": {
                            "imageProps.src": "src",
                            "commonProps.hidden": "hidden"
                        },
                        "imageProps": {
                            "src": "",
                            "innerAlign": "contain"
                        },
                        "placement": {
                            "width": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherIconSize}",
                            "height": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherIconSize}"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "label",
                        "id": "icon",
                        "commonProps": {
                            "clickable": false,
                            "hidden": true
                        },
                        "bindings": {
                            "labelProps.text": "text",
                            "commonProps.hidden": "hidden"
                        },
                        "labelProps": {
                            "text": ""
                        },
                        "styleRefs": [
                            "shell.launcherFallbackIcon"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "styleRefs": [
                    "shell.launcherIconTile"
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "container",
                "id": "title_box",
                "commonProps": {
                    "clickable": false
                },
                "layout": {
                    "type": "flex",
                    "mainAlign": "center",
                    "crossAlign": "center"
                },
                "placement": {
                    "width": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherItemWidth}",
                    "height": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherTitleBoxHeight}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "label",
                        "id": "app_name",
                        "commonProps": {
                            "clickable": false
                        },
                        "bindings": {
                            "labelProps.text": "name"
                        },
                        "labelProps": {
                            "text": ""
                        },
                        "style": {
                            "fontSize": "${constant.ui.metric.captionFont}"
                        },
                        "styleRefs": [
                            "shell.launcherAppLabel"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "styleRefs": [
            "shell.launcherAppButton"
        ]
    }
}
